8
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:48,520
are really strong for DIDWebs. I think if
the work that we're doing on DIDWebs

9
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:58,320
disappeared tomorrow, it would be too bad.
I think that there as long as there's a

10
00:00:58,320 --> 00:01:04,180
decentralized identified identifier market
and infrastructure out there, having a

11
00:01:04,180 --> 00:01:09,500
bridge between that ecosystem and the KERI
ecosystem makes a lot of sense. There are

12
